          <li><a href="https://www.reddit.com/r/FortressOne">Reddit</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://twitter.com/fortressone_dev">Twitter</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=22777321">Hacker News</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
